---
import SocialIcons from '../components/SocialIcons.astro';
import { socials } from '../config/socials';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Soumyo Dey is Founder of Oogway Labs, previously led the Connected Vehicle Platform and Data & AI products at Ather Energy, and co-founded Krayen."
>
  <header class="grid-12 gap-y-4 pb-14 pt-4 md:pb-20">
    <p class="c-label mono">About</p>
    <div class="c-body">
      <h1 class="t-title">A systems thinker with a product brain</h1>
      <p class="t-lead mt-8 max-w-[40rem] text-[var(--color-text)]">
        I've always gravitated toward problems where engineering, intelligence, and real-world constraints intersect. What started as a curiosity for how things work turned into a career spent building products and platforms that make complex systems feel simple.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="band grid-12 gap-y-4">
    <p class="c-label mono sec-num">Now</p>
    <div class="c-body">
      <h2 class="t-heading">Founder, Oogway Labs</h2>
      <p class="about-copy mt-6">
        I run <a class="link" href="https://oogwaylabs.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Oogway Labs</a>, an AI-native consulting and engineering firm. The stance is execution over hype: we build systems that hold up in production, and say so plainly when something won't.
      </p>
      <p class="about-copy mt-4">
        Much of that work has been in healthcare: voice-first, workflow-aware AI systems that remove administrative friction for clinicians. It spans system architecture, multi-agent intelligence, voice interfaces, and the operational realities of deploying AI in clinical environments.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band grid-12 gap-y-4">
    <p class="c-label mono sec-num">Before</p>
    <div class="c-body">
      <h2 class="t-heading">Before that: Senior Technical Product Manager, Ather Energy</h2>
      <p class="about-copy mt-6">
        I led the Connected Vehicle Platform and Data & AI product strategy through Ather's fastest growth phase, from 25,000 to 600,000+ EVs on the road. That meant owning the vehicle connectivity platform behind real-time telemetry, customer experience, and operations; building data products used across vehicle software, R&D, service, and customer teams; and driving AI/ML work like predictive maintenance and support automation, with teams spanning data engineering, data science, product, and engineering.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band grid-12 gap-y-4">
    <p class="c-label mono sec-num">Earlier</p>
    <div class="c-body">
      <h2 class="t-heading">A first startup, and the data work before it</h2>
      <div class="about-copy mt-6 space-y-4">
        <p>
          Before Ather, I co-founded Krayen as Chief Product Officer and built a data-driven CRM from zero to market: product vision, architecture, go-to-market, and the core data infrastructure. It ended in a successful exit, and taught me what separates products that ship from products that stall.
        </p>
        <p>
          I started out as a data scientist at Convergytics and a product manager at Blik.ai, working across e-commerce, retail, and supply chain, where I designed data platforms and product systems that improved clarity, speed, and operational decision-making.
        </p>
        <p>
          These roles shaped how I approach problem definition, system architecture, and delivering intelligence that works in the real world.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band grid-12 gap-y-4">
    <p class="c-label mono sec-num">Method</p>
    <div class="c-body">
      <h2 class="t-heading">Where intelligence meets execution</h2>
      <div class="about-copy mt-6 space-y-4">
        <p>I focus on clarity, precision, and real-world usefulness. I enjoy working end-to-end:</p>
        <ul class="about-list">
          <li>defining problems</li>
          <li>shaping system and data architecture</li>
          <li>building AI-native products</li>
          <li>refining interfaces that tie everything together</li>
        </ul>
        <p>I bias toward shipping, learning, and continuous improvement — always grounded in how people actually work.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band grid-12 gap-y-4">
    <p class="c-label mono sec-num">Writing</p>
    <div class="c-body">
      <h2 class="t-heading">Why I write</h2>
      <div class="about-copy mt-6 space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'm constantly exploring the edges of applied AI — voice interfaces, multi-agent systems, workflow design, and the mechanics of building intelligence that actually holds up in the real world.
        </p>
        <p>
          I write to clarify my thinking: short pieces on product intuition, engineering systems, and signals from the AI landscape. This site is where I publish that exploration.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band grid-12 gap-y-4">
    <p class="c-label mono sec-num">Contact</p>
    <div class="c-body">
      <h2 class="t-heading">Get in touch</h2>
      <p class="about-copy mt-6">
        If you'd like to reach out, collaborate, or just say hello, here are the easiest ways:
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {socials.map((social) => <SocialIcons {...social} />)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-copy {
    max-width: 38rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .about-list {
    list-style: square;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-list li {
    padding-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  .about-list li::marker {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
